  m_Text: 'WASD or arrows move. This scene has Hide Spots, so Q hides only inside
    a bush.

    Press Q out in the open: nothing happens. Walk into a bush, then
    press Q.

    The slime sees all around. Once it is chasing you, it keeps going
    3 seconds after you hide.'
